oint we just need to make  a mark on the other two I usually just  eyeball it but if you want to you can  use a ruler so right about there and  there so we can now draw a line from the  point out through the base here that's 3  and 3/4 inches and making a mark at that  3 inch point draw a 3 and 3/4 inch line  and make a mark at 3 inches now that  we've completed this one we could do the  remaining 2  you should have something that looks  just like this now we're now going to  draw three two inch wide lines which  will lay directly on the last mark that  we made at the three inch point take the  ruler and place the 1-inch measurement  directly on the existing line and the  mark that we previously made then you  could draw a line from the zero to the  two inch measurement making sure it is  perpendicular to the existing line then  just do the same for the other two now  all we need to do is just connect the  edges of the two-inch line with the  corners of the triangle that it faces on  all three sides trying to be as neat as  possible draw a line from the corner of  the triangle here to the end of the  two-inch line continue to do the same  until you have six lines total and it  looks something like the diagram I  showed  to complete the overall outline of the  boomerang we just need to draw a  semicircle that goes from one end of the  two-inch line to the other touching the  end of the central lines as shown here I  do this part purely by eye but if you  are not good at drawing semi circles  then you can use possibly like a piece  of tape or some sort of cap it doesn't  really matter you just need to make a  semicircle just like that  so I'm just gonna do it by hand so I'm  just gently drawing a curved line from  the edge of the two-inch wide line over  the top of the central line so that it  looks like semicircle in EIU's shape and  then you could do the same with the  other two so it should look something  like that  lastly we just need to draw the line for  the ai